msgid ""
"Customize the \"Open in Gallery\" buttons that can be added to slides, "
"images, galleries, and videos."
msgstr ""
"Kustomisasi tombol \"Buka di Galeri\" yang dapat ditambahkan ke slide, "
"gambar, galeri, dan video."

